msgid "Allow AI bot crawling"
msgstr "Consenti la scansione ai bot di IA"

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:278
msgid ""
"If off, robots.txt asks AI crawlers (GPTBot, ChatGPT-User, Google-Extended, "
"CCBot, Anthropic, Meta, Bytespider, PerplexityBot) to stay away."
msgstr ""
"Se disattivo, robots.txt chiede ai crawler di IA (GPTBot, ChatGPT-User, "
"Google-Extended, CCBot, Anthropic, Meta, Bytespider, PerplexityBot) di stare "
"alla larga."

